.el .ds Aq '
.TH sway-things-brightness-set 1 "" "Sway Things 0.5.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-brightness\-set \- Set the brightness, in percent: 50% or 50
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things brightness set\fR [\fB\-\-device\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIVALUE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the brightness, in percent: 50% or 50
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-device\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
The backlight or keyboard light by its name in /sys/class/backlight or /sys/class/leds, e.g. `intel_backlight` or `tpacpi::kbd_backlight`
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIVALUE\fR>
The brightness, from 0 to 100 (a backlight stays at 1 % at least)
